      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I was able to investigate this more and it is an issue specific to my own custom fallback.\n\nBecause my fallback is made from my good rank version, just stripped down, it still had parts of TFKM's avatar scaling system in it (https://thatfatkidsmom.gumroad.com/l/dbezuo). Specifically the tpose controller and AvatarScale parameter. FX layer didn't have any of the avatar scaling layers though. \n\nRemoving the tpose controller fixed the issue and the fallback now scales as it should.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
